#: scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31ce34f5656f8f7cc03b66f35b4cf2c695f09cfe9b215424ffcd4ad3500c04df
#. default-sha256: 989bfe400248f2a7bfbc7ef559150ef00e68d27c62a5586c7da17f8f092dd05a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—nothing. ⟪k:1⟫He could not speak."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫声を――⟪k:1⟫上げることは、⟪k:2⟫出来ませんでした。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫白い髪を持つ少女のシルエットは、"
"⟪k:5⟫まさしく彼女そのもの。"

#: scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e784359c00b7cd70ce675495db996d35b3b369c27b99c01f107b83bd85b46d8a
#. default-sha256: 976a065027030641479dee5f5983db1511f9bc74ea62cefbc2bd89da077b82d8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The silhouette hanging above him was certainly the White-Haired Girl’s. ⟪k:1⟫Or was it? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Because his next words were—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……いいえ、⟪k:1⟫本当にそうだったのでしょうか？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫だって、⟪k:4⟫今の言葉は――"

#: scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad3f0eaf4e7bdd9df295eb2d0536b156ab8b13d10ca7d0ecd16587bfd4c108b7
