msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He reflexively shoved the girl straddling him aside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫彼は咄嗟に、⟪k:3⟫覆いかぶさる白い髪の娘を突き飛ばしました。"

#: scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abdea2316f887dccb9a46354cf913e5750482991732e70fa8920c97e422daddc
#. default-sha256: 34d19bfa9beb86baf9f2d9842972cecdd53fe40a0d0b938398f904d4ec030a0b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She rolled off the bed, landing on the cold floor, ⟪k:1⟫but slowly, gradually, she crawled "
"her way back toward him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女はベッドから転び落ち、⟪k:1⟫冷たい床に叩きつけられましたが、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫徐々に、⟪k:4⟫徐々"
"に、⟪k:5⟫這うようにして彼に近付いていくのです。"

#: scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f2c7a2c489a2d215e8200ad16fa869c81f63ef8a829ad3bd835ad9d2fd486bd
