msgctxt "scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ひどいじゃない……。"

#: scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c9776508f0e00fcf3b03e2be876bb12e3261d630bb73a568d6ad93ff6601a56
#. default-sha256: b6a0ea3d7043bb87df094a70bb055feb70fdecb03223d0079e3dd16cb94d73e6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Veiled in darkness, she slowly lifted her head. ⟪k:1⟫And then—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫there was another "
"flash of lightning.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫暗闇の中、⟪k:1⟫彼女はゆっくりと顔を持ちあげました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫そして――⟪k:4⟫再び、⟪k:5⟫雷鳴。"
"⟪k:6⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2d246219a8abda141aa8e836aa5a9d2ffe5ca3021c91a3b7395927385599a4d
#. default-sha256: a3b5dfdc55e681fa01519eede02b9ff46b1220dfcb4712a805617c3666908e25
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The heavy fabric of the curtains rustled, bolts of light streaming between the gaps."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫重いカーテンの隙間が波打ち、⟪k:1⟫光が矢のように差し込みます。"

#: scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c87ad9f3174f16fb9f1e76a6ca1e8c3289a8f010dd63f3a024421e8933f7fbb
#. default-sha256: 61448ec02e3d738d7611c25c01e1265f11285c8986199e7fcd98ffbe3e97a6c1
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Her flaxen irises glimmered. ⟪k:21⟫Though in the bluish-white light, they took "
"on a twinge of almost golden glow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫……その瞳は亜麻色に輝いておりました。⟪k:21⟫いいえ、⟪k:22⟫亜麻色を通り越して、"
"⟪k:23⟫青白い雷鳴を受けた瞳は、⟪k:24⟫さながら金のよう。"

#: scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fc760b7d452b4ee91a385e289431ac3d0b751a04a30da53205e05b4158c51a3
#. default-sha256: c0e5253aee74ef4d50f49a2d331224d96b86071954129cf7aae5fe5c39f446e4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so rough.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This isn’t the first time she’s visited your bedchamber,"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is it, Mell?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫何度も寝室に訪れたんでしょ？⟪k:1⟫　邪険にしないでもいいじゃない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ねえ……、⟪k:4⟫メ"
"ル？"

#: scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8362d75d5747b79355861d38bfce2dcf7f566efd18549eee4021bf7a98ed59c5
#. default-sha256: 6ed7fbfcaa0a651f636d4467f242ed887b372374f2e486f8bb1ebbcff8e562fc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or did I not kiss you the same way?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tell me, how does she run her fingers across "
"your skin?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What does she do when she nuzzles up to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それとも……、⟪k:1⟫キスの仕方が違ったのかしら？⟪k:2⟫　教えて……あの人は、⟪k:3⟫どんな風にあなたに"
"触れて、⟪k:4⟫どんな風に甘えたの……。"

#: scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1cb5f909397e13f7e83742c094b201a9149e8ce72dae9c064fa6045bd102e136
#. default-sha256: a1d373756083846c71a56b4e22644de9373999bd8432f834b8ff3c400fab445d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stop— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Stop this madness, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Wh-"
"⟪k:11⟫Why would you... ⟪k:12⟫Why would you do this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ば……、⟪k:1⟫ばかな、⟪k:2⟫――馬鹿な真似はよせ、⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫ネリーッ！！！⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫な、"
"⟪k:9⟫何のつもりで、⟪k:10⟫こんな……こんな……！！"

#: scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37b9820a099402bd1903769c8f1a0f332cdec896750cd9fda5d0cd1d1116f301
#. default-sha256: f37a2fe30392a1c060a02f9068127da63b316ff18149f9cdbb7a5d89cf5f526a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you like white hair, don’t you, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You like white hair, which is why you "
"fell for her, isn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だって……メルは白い髪が好きだったんでしょ？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫白い髪が好きだったから、⟪k:3⟫あの子を好き"
"になったんでしょ？"

#: scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9edb091ce0b4fbcbe02b05b67591beec01c91fd7d80892222976a2c5ff0bc236
#. default-sha256: 46767b0e2e8ee36c72d3d5ff7e40636bb1c3d4305bd4f8fa36ce4748924ca4dd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫So if I have white hair, then you’ll fall for me too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then I can be "
"your princess again, dearest Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あはは……、⟪k:1⟫だったら白い髪になれば、⟪k:2⟫ネリーだって同じよね。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫またお兄さまのお"
"姫さまになれるのよね。"

#: scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c0163da0ea2d8fe68e46561a866e299cb6247a6ace0b4305a44a50667355033
#. default-sha256: 8eb0cd96207cfa27c6206138e13657238b9ba8676f766b4d73a50d69ee5545aa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なに……なにを、⟪k:1⟫わけのわからないことを……。"

#: scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6f64f8dc6367514a98e8afe73ca1e0bc1468c1af2d6c98e2782c34860798714
#. default-sha256: 49b32c6210beba7e1be608c2af0d4a2cc937101091e58ade311c9fe3b6342b4f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not escape from her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫from his sister’s piercing gaze. ⟪k:3⟫“Why?” “What "
"happened?” “How could she?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼は、⟪k:1⟫彼女――⟪k:2⟫妹の射るような眼差しから、⟪k:3⟫逃れることが出来ませんでした。⟪k:4⟫な"
"ぜ？⟪k:5⟫　どうして？⟪k:6⟫　何があって？"

#: scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 414e1a0bce1768d128d6a7bafbbc78b4e9195d81bd6f3ee9f41fda992250c78f
#. default-sha256: fdfbc749fbe15abd16a3faa8f44bd0603924ab55c67b1977250368e0b7a246b9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Questions crashed into the young man’s mind like waves in a stormy sea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……彼の頭の中は、⟪k:1⟫怒涛のごとく疑問で溢れています。"

#: scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5e7f3de47b76a8d4c203cbefb6c4613a19d609eac875fdd6fd48b2e10cc3515
#. default-sha256: c03a0a3578bffa6f11105660beafdab257721ece463b7b8d7f04d2a9b53ccd23
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But none of them found answers; they simply caused him further perplexity."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そのどれもが解決を帯びず、⟪k:1⟫ただ、⟪k:2⟫凍りついていくのみ。"

#: scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4bd19583015708e4aef6a0327bf274a7f86d7f10ad5a5c6667848344dfda6d01
#. default-sha256: 5fd70c32d0a8c21b4ff66fbf583b734614574e494448f290e813658af4265a76
